      "id": "rationale--ggml-native-default-on-defeats-avx512-off",
      "label": "GGML_NATIVE defaults ON and compiles the whole baseline with -march=native, so AVX512=OFF alone was not enough",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "05 - Conversations/home-belajarcarabelajar-proyek-snipset/2026-09-23 - dukungan-appimage-snipset-di-arch-linux [ses_f307e386bffeYlPW4CvAW2eqoU].md",
      "source_location": "L7613",
      "norm_label": "ggml_native defaults on and compiles the whole baseline with -march=native, so avx512=off alone was not enough"
    },
    {
      "id": "rationale--whole-binary-evex-scan-false-positives",
      "label": "The guard was narrowed to the dispatch path because whole-binary EVEX scans false-positive on dormant AVX512 in upstream variant kernels",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "05 - Conversations/home-belajarcarabelajar-proyek-snipset/2026-09-23 - dukungan-appimage-snipset-di-arch-linux [ses_f307e386bffeYlPW4CvAW2eqoU].md",
      "source_location": "L7614",
      "norm_label": "the guard was narrowed to the dispatch path because whole binary evex scans false positive on dormant avx512 in upstream variant kernels"
    },
    {
      "id": "rationale--cargo-clean-purge-needed-for-env-flag",
      "label": "cargo clean -p whisper-rs-sys is required for the flag to actually take effect, because the old cache keeps the AVX512 objects",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "05 - Conversations/home-belajarcarabelajar-proyek-snipset/2026-09-23 - dukungan-appimage-snipset-di-arch-linux [ses_f307e386bffeYlPW4CvAW2eqoU].md",
      "source_location": "L4267",
      "norm_label": "cargo clean -p whisper-rs-sys is required for the flag to actually take effect, because the old cache keeps the avx512 objects"
    },
    {
